            <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/PluginsForIOS.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;Building Plugins for iOS&lt;/a&gt; is a guide from Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two approaches&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Approach 1: Put plugin source code &lt;code&gt;.mm,.c,.cpp&lt;/code&gt; files in &lt;code&gt;Assets/Plugins/iOS&lt;/code&gt; folder.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Approach 2: Build plugin library to &lt;code&gt;.a&lt;/code&gt; file then put it in &lt;code&gt;Assets/Plugins/iOS&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/14834626/how-to-build-unity3d-plugin-for-ios&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;How to build Unity3d Plugin for iOS&lt;/a&gt; experience from a developer&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://blogs.shephertz.com/2013/08/23/bridging-the-gap-plugin-for-unity-and-ios/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;Plugin for Unity and iOS&lt;/a&gt; iOS plugin with source code inside Asset folder&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://www.slideshare.net/kaijungchen/unity3-d-plugins-development-guide-29659247&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;Unity3D Plugins Development Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
